<title>ISRAEL: Israel's Netanyhahu, Levy to U.S. next month.</title>
<headline>Israel's Netanyhahu, Levy to U.S. next month.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu and Foreign Minister David Levy will travel to the United States at the end of June to attend a United Nations conference on the environment, an official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;As yet there have been no meetings scheduled with President Clinton, but it's very likely there will be discussions to this end,&quot; said Netanyahu's spokesman Shai Bazak.</p>
</text>
